perados es 3,8, con un intervalo de confianza del 95 % de 2,3 a 6,2. En diciembre se adjudicó el 22 % de los contratos junto al límite, mientras que diciembre supone el 12 % de todos sus contratos de servicios y suministros. Los contratos junto al límite se reparten entre 29 adjudicatarios distintos. El contrato [1], de 14.950 euros, se adjudicó en diciembre de 2025.\nQué no pueden demostrar: La concentración de contratos al límite no indica malas prácticas. Puede deberse a precios de mercado o necesidades específicas. No hay datos que confirman abusos.\nQué se puede revisar: Comprobar si los contratos al límite se reparten entre distintos proveedores. Ver si el adjudicatario A repite contratos en áreas similares. Analizar si los contratos de diciembre abarcan necesidades distintas.","en":"What the data shows: Between 2023 and 2025, this body awarded 32 minor contracts for services and supplies above 14,000 and up to 15,000 euros, just under the legal limit. If those amounts were spread as in the band immediately below, 8.4 contracts would be expected. The observed-to-expected ratio is 3.8, with a 95% confidence interval of 2.3 to 6.2. December accounts for 22% of the contracts just under the limit, compared with 12% of all its services and supplies contracts. The awardee with the most contracts just under the limit, called awardee A here, has 3. Contract [1], for 14,950 euros, was awarded in December 2025.\nWhat it cannot show: The concentration of contracts in December does not indicate improper activity. Similar patterns can occur due to seasonal demand or budget planning. Small amounts near the limit do not prove violations, as market prices or fixed budgets may influence decisions.\nWhat can be checked: Check the dates and values of contracts to see if they align with seasonal trends. Review the awardee A's contracts to determine if multiple contracts serve the same need. Examine if repeated orders from the same provider suggest a pattern beyond random variation.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"modelo","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"ss","citas":["gIi4GEH3uMy2gkLQ8TeYKA%3D%3D","LjeImgbIexMZDGvgaZEVxQ%3D%3D","4J6Jy%2FWQSAV4zIRvjBVCSw%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-16"}}